{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "_comment": [
    "The COLUMN file of the onboarding matrix, symmetric to scenarios.json's rows (#1369).",
    "maturity  — the tier this adapter CLAIMS. `of validate` fails when the claim outruns the",
    "            evidence in replaydata/; it never rewrites the claim. Ladder and the core-12",
    "            floor each tier requires: tools/onboarding-factory/internal/matrix/vocabulary.go.",
    "capabilities — only the NON-DEFAULT values. An omitted trait means 'traced': the adapter has",
    "            the feature and it reaches a Source the adapter reads. 'absent' means the agent",
    "            does not have the feature (derives n/a); 'untraced' means it has it but exercising",
    "            it leaves no trace (derives unobservable). Trait ids are a closed set defined in",
    "            internal/matrix/capability.go — a trait not named there is a validation finding.",
    "A pair declared absent/untraced needs NO cell directory: the matrix synthesizes it. The 122",
    "cells that predate this file keep their directories, and `of validate` pins each one against",
    "the declaration here."
  ],
